        extra='''<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Recorded PCB2 development results · 13 October 2026</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Configuration</th><th scope="col">Detected</th><th scope="col">False alarms</th><th scope="col">AUROC</th><th scope="col">Median</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Full 256</th><td>36/50</td><td>3/50</td><td>0.9308</td><td>22.8 ms</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Crop 256</th><td>41/50</td><td>2/50</td><td>0.9564</td><td>25.2 ms</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Crop 512</th><td>43/50</td><td>1/50</td><td>0.9888</td><td>38.5 ms</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="fine">Latency: warm-cache, batch one, RTX 5070 Ti Laptop GPU; 3 warmups / 20 repetitions, decode + inference, excluding model loading and output writing. The reserved holdout has not been evaluated. Source documentation reports 29 local unit tests; these were not rerun for this portfolio.</p>'''
